      "message": "this is sort of an existing problem but:\n\n - it\u0027s probably better to have a method on the Store to clear out all temporary buffers. otherwise when people add other things to the internal store, they will likely forget to clear the resources here.\n \n - it\u0027s odd that it is called a \"pipeline store\" but it also stores buffers. I believe this is because it was initially only pipelines, and then we added other objects as well. I think it would be appropriate to rename it to \"internal object store\".\n\n - the temporary uniform buffer should probably be in the internal store, instead of on the device.\n \n \nAt the very least, I think we should add something like `store-\u003eDropTemporaryBuffers()` now. The other renames and moving of things can happen if separate CLs if you\u0027d like",
